### Auth REST client — start Postgres; use launch "Auth Service (local, no Eureka)" or --spring.profiles.active=local without discovery-server
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Register new account
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "playerw1464123w",
  "password": "secret12"
}

### Login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "uus",
  "password": "testik"
}

### Login as seeded admin (password from DataInitializer)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

